hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3002","Narrated to us 'Abd al-Jabbar ibn al-'Ala', narrated to us Sufyan, from al-Zuhri, from 'Urwah, from 'A'ishah (RA) who said:\n\"Safiyyah (RA) menstruated, and this was mentioned to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ). He said: 'Is she detaining us?' I (i.e., 'A'ishah) said: 'She menstruated after having performed the Ifadah (i.e., the Farewell Tawaf).'\nHe (ﷺ) said: 'Then there is no harm, so let her depart.'\"\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
